        .pt: ["Include public Internet checks":"Incluir verificações públicas da Internet", "When enabled, scheduled reports contact Google, Apple and api.ipify.org; api.ipify.org returns your public IP. Turn this off to omit these app-added checks from every scheduled run.":"Quando ativadas, as execuções agendadas contactam o Google, a Apple e api.ipify.org; api.ipify.org devolve o seu IP público. Desative esta opção para omitir estas verificações adicionais em todas as execuções agendadas.", "Public checks on":"Verificações públicas ativas", "Public checks off":"Verificações públicas desativadas", "System proxy used":"Proxy do sistema utilizado", "No system proxy used":"Nenhum proxy do sistema utilizado", "Proxy use unknown":"Utilização do proxy desconhecida", "System proxy used:":"Proxy do sistema utilizado:", "Choose a CSV containing host, port and protocol columns.":"Escolha um CSV com colunas host, porta e protocolo.", "Choose a reports folder":"Escolher pasta de relatórios", "Click to view results":"Clique para ver os resultados", "Completed:":"Concluídos:", "Hostnames use the macOS system DNS resolver. Configured servers are listed, but macOS does not report which one answered a lookup. You cannot choose a DNS server in NetworkPortEval.":"Os nomes de host usam o resolvedor DNS do macOS. Os servidores configurados são listados, mas o macOS não informa qual respondeu a uma consulta. O NetworkPortEval não permite escolher um servidor DNS.", "Date:":"Data:", "Each web check contacts its named public service. The local MAC is not sent to remote hosts.":"Cada verificação Web contacta o serviço público indicado. O MAC local não é enviado para hosts remotos.", "Export format":"Formato de exportação", "Failed/inconclusive:":"Falhados/inconclusivos:", "Import a CSV to get started":"Importe um CSV para começar", "Internet status:":"Estado da Internet:", "No completed report yet":"Ainda não há relatórios concluídos", "Report name":"Nome do relatório", "TCP checks connectivity, not TLS or application health. UDP requires a response; silence is inconclusive.":"TCP verifica a conectividade, não TLS nem o estado da aplicação. UDP precisa de resposta; o silêncio é inconclusivo.", "Test results":"Resultados dos testes", "Tests:":"Testes:", "Unavailable":"Indisponível", "Use standard folder":"Usar pasta padrão", "confirmed":"confirmados", "flows":"fluxos", "Optional UDP request bytes in hexadecimal. Leave blank for a generic probe; some services require a specific request.":"Bytes de pedido UDP opcionais em hexadecimal. Deixe em branco para uma sonda genérica; alguns serviços exigem um pedido específico."],
        .zh: ["Include public Internet checks":"包含公共互联网检查", "When enabled, scheduled reports contact Google, Apple and api.ipify.org; api.ipify.org returns your public IP. Turn this off to omit these app-added checks from every scheduled run.":"启用后，计划报告会联系 Google、Apple 和 api.ipify.org；api.ipify.org 会返回你的公网 IP。关闭此选项后，所有计划运行都会省略这些应用附加检查。", "Public checks on":"已启用公共检查", "Public checks off":"已停用公共检查", "System proxy used":"已使用系统代理", "No system proxy used":"未使用系统代理", "Proxy use unknown":"代理使用情况未知", "System proxy used:":"已使用系统代理：", "Choose a CSV containing host, port and protocol columns.":"请选择包含主机、端口和协议列的 CSV 文件。", "Choose a reports folder":"选择报告文件夹", "Click to view results":"点击查看结果", "Completed:":"已完成：", "Hostnames use the macOS system DNS resolver. Configured servers are listed, but macOS does not report which one answered a lookup. You cannot choose a DNS server in NetworkPortEval.":"主机名使用 macOS 系统 DNS 解析器。报告会列出已配置的服务器，但 macOS 不会说明哪个服务器响应了某次查询。NetworkPortEval 不提供 DNS 服务器选择功能。", "Date:":"日期：", "Each web check contacts its named public service. The local MAC is not sent to remote hosts.":"每项 Web 检查都会联系对应的公共服务。本地 MAC 地址不会发送给远程主机。", "Export format":"导出格式", "Failed/inconclusive:":"失败/无法确定：", "Import a CSV to get started":"导入 CSV 以开始使用", "Internet status:":"互联网状态：", "No completed report yet":"尚无已完成的报告", "Report name":"报告名称", "TCP checks connectivity, not TLS or application health. UDP requires a response; silence is inconclusive.":"TCP 检查连接情况，不检查 TLS 或应用状态。UDP 需要收到响应；无响应无法确定结果。", "Test results":"测试结果", "Tests:":"测试：", "Unavailable":"不可用", "Use standard folder":"使用默认文件夹", "confirmed":"已确认", "flows":"个连接", "Optional UDP request bytes in hexadecimal. Leave blank for a generic probe; some services require a specific request.":"可选的 UDP 十六进制请求字节。留空则发送通用探测；某些服务需要特定请求。"],
        .ja: ["Include public Internet checks":"公開インターネットチェックを含める", "When enabled, scheduled reports contact Google, Apple and api.ipify.org; api.ipify.org returns your public IP. Turn this off to omit these app-added checks from every scheduled run.":"有効にすると、スケジュールされたレポートは Google、Apple、api.ipify.org に接続します。api.ipify.org はグローバル IP を返します。無効にすると、すべてのスケジュール実行でこれらの追加チェックを省略します。", "Public checks on":"公開チェック有効", "Public checks off":"公開チェック無効", "System proxy used":"システムプロキシを使用", "No system proxy used":"システムプロキシ未使用", "Proxy use unknown":"プロキシの使用状況は不明", "System proxy used:":"システムプロキシの使用：", "Choose a CSV containing host, port and protocol columns.":"host、port、protocol 列を含む CSV を選択してください。", "Choose a reports folder":"レポートフォルダを選択", "Click to view results":"クリックして結果を表示", "Completed:":"完了：", "Hostnames use the macOS system DNS resolver. Configured servers are listed, but macOS does not report which one answered a lookup. You cannot choose a DNS server in NetworkPortEval.":"ホスト名の解決には macOS のシステム DNS リゾルバを使用します。設定済みサーバーは表示されますが、個々の問い合わせにどのサーバーが応答したかは macOS から確認できません。NetworkPortEval では DNS サーバーを選択できません。", "Date:":"日付：", "Each web check contacts its named public service. The local MAC is not sent to remote hosts.":"各Webチェックは表示された公開サービスに接続します。ローカルMACアドレスはリモートホストに送信されません。", "Export format":"書き出し形式", "Failed/inconclusive:":"失敗／判定不能：", "Import a CSV to get started":"CSVを読み込んで開始", "Internet status:":"インターネット状態：", "No completed report yet":"完了したレポートはありません", "Report name":"レポート名", "TCP checks connectivity, not TLS or application health. UDP requires a response; silence is inconclusive.":"TCPは接続性を確認し、TLSやアプリケーションの状態は確認しません。UDPは応答が必要で、無応答では判定できません。", "Test results":"テスト結果", "Tests:":"テスト：", "Unavailable":"利用不可", "Use standard folder":"標準フォルダを使用", "confirmed":"確認済み", "flows":"フロー", "Optional UDP request bytes in hexadecimal. Leave blank for a generic probe; some services require a specific request.":"任意の UDP リクエストデータを16進数で指定します。汎用プローブの場合は空欄にします。サービスによっては専用リクエストが必要です。"],
        .fr: ["Include public Internet checks":"Inclure les vérifications Internet publiques", "When enabled, scheduled reports contact Google, Apple and api.ipify.org; api.ipify.org returns your public IP. Turn this off to omit these app-added checks from every scheduled run.":"Lorsqu’elles sont activées, les exécutions planifiées contactent Google, Apple et api.ipify.org ; ce dernier renvoie votre IP publique. Désactivez cette option pour omettre ces vérifications ajoutées par l’application à chaque exécution planifiée.", "Public checks on":"Vérifications publiques activées", "Public checks off":"Vérifications publiques désactivées", "System proxy used":"Proxy système utilisé", "No system proxy used":"Aucun proxy système utilisé", "Proxy use unknown":"Utilisation du proxy inconnue", "System proxy used:":"Proxy système utilisé :"],
    ]
}
